<title>SRI LANKA: Int'l Spice Group seeks pepper futures exchange.</title>
<headline>Int'l Spice Group seeks pepper futures exchange.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Spice Group plans to launch an International Pepper Futures Exchange, the first of its kind for spices, an official of the group said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The exchange, to open in Cochin, south India, in January 1997, will help hedge options for buyers and sellers of pepper, the most widely used spice in the world, Fazil Husain, senior commodity marketing officer of the International Trade Centre, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
